<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hidden in the hollow</l><l>Of His blessed hand,</l><l>Never foe can follow,</l><l>Never traitor stand;</l><l>Not a surge of worry,</l><l>Not a shade of care,</l><l>Not a blast of hurry</l><l>Touch the spirit there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Every joy or trial</l><l>Falleth from above,</l><l>Traced upon our dial</l><l>By the Sun of Love.</l><l>We may trust Him fully</l><l>All for us to do;</l><l>They who trust Him wholly</l><l>Find Him wholly true.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
